    {
      "id": "claim_dcd90a32ed82471bb9b0b43f73db6e36",
      "statement": "The application exposes exactly four outward-facing surfaces: parent routes under /v1 authenticated by any valid token, editor routes under /v1/editor that additionally require app_metadata.hq_role = editor, /health/live which returns ok without touching the database, and /health/ready which proves the database and migrations are usable and returns 503 otherwise.",
