      "id": "claim_c8300522306c4f5aabada19ec225c357",
      "statement": "Daily occurrences, completion approvals, Spark transactions, screen-time enforcement, world rendering, redemption, formal RAGAS/LangSmith experiments and a frontend are explicitly outside this backend slice, and proposed point fields are catalog metadata rather than awards, so a reader should not look for those features in this repository.",
