      "id": "claim_9af899ca957b4192a9daf9785e681194",
      "statement": "create_app(settings) installs a lifespan that always constructs a daemon Thread named plan-worker running worker.serve but starts it only when run_worker_in_api is true, and on shutdown sets the stop event and joins with max_run_seconds, so an in-flight model call can be abandoned rather than blocking process exit.",
