      "statement": "The module split assigns plan-document rules and publication limits to service.py, the agent pipeline and provider adapters to planning.py, the durable claim/heartbeat/publish loop to worker.py, and deterministic catalog read-model decisions to the catalog package, so a behaviour change belongs in the module that owns that decision rather than in the route handler.",
