      "id": "claim_873abc08c70d452aa201aa9272482361",
      "statement": "db.transaction() is the single chokepoint that turns a caller into a database role and scope: passing editor selects hq_editor, worker=True selects hq_worker, otherwise hq_api, and the caller identity is published as the transaction-local settings app.parent_id and app.editor_id that hq.my_parent() and hq.my_editor() read.",
