    {
      "id": "claim_df7a65bd82174c8fbe993091b6baa2b4",
      "statement": "load_release() is the only place where the editor and planning view families are reconciled: it reads hq.current_release by default and the released_* views, or the release_* views when candidate=True is passed by an editor, which is why a draft inside an unpublished release is never visible to the worker or hq_api.",
