      "id": "claim_8fb1f53c588642feb1b3688eedef1276",
      "statement": "service.validate_sources() is the seam that converts catalog drift into an explicit failure: it takes hq.lock_release() share locks, rejects a changed policy_version, reloads the current release, and raises 409 replan_required when an active habit or chapter was withdrawn, superseded or dropped; it runs at worker publication, at proposal confirmation and per habit during parent edits.",
