      "id": "claim_3223c5c76d834d40b9c36e1bea8b0218",
      "statement": "Planning decides in two layers: deterministic code builds candidates and shortlists and validates every pick and publication limit, while the model only chooses within those server-scoped lists; a mapping that does not quote the parent's words, a pick outside the shortlist, or a Reviewer rejection gets one revision and then the reviewed deterministic template is published with fallback: true.",
