      "id": "claim_934f2d5bc41342c7aa2775daf8b2aec3",
      "statement": "The two-person editorial rules are enforced inside SECURITY DEFINER database functions and table checks rather than only in the API: hq.transition_version refuses self-approval and requires a rejection reason, hq.build_release and hq.publish_release take a shared advisory lock, and the API merely maps SQLSTATEs 42501/ P0002/55000/22023 to 403/404/409/422.",
