      "statement": "Publishing a release flips the single is_current pointer enforced by a partial unique index, and withdrawal is the separate emergency path: hq.withdraw_habit marks every approved version of a habit withdrawn permanently and inserts a habit_withdrawn plan_flags row for each child's newest plan that uses it.",
