      "id": "claim_c8e772affe384cdea18132a126df63d9",
      "statement": "Two deployment shapes use the same code path: render_start.sh applies pending migrations then serves uvicorn with RUN_WORKER_IN_API=true so the worker polls on a thread inside one Render service, while production sets it false and runs python -m habitquest_backend.worker as a separate service; the standalone worker's main() loops run_once and the console script hq-worker resolves to the same function.",
