      "statement": "Route documentation and process boundaries are pinned by tests rather than convention: test_every_endpoint_is_documented fails if any OpenAPI operation lacks a summary, a description of at least 40 characters or a declared tag, and test_worker_runs_inside_the_api_when_enabled asserts that no plan-worker thread outlives the app context.",
